A54. This is more accurate. ~ TRUER
A56. Tootsie's "Good-Bye." (With apologies to Mr. Tosti.) ~ BYEBYE
A59. This is the hot season down south. ~ PEPPER
A63. This is what Paul Revere did. ~ RODE
A64. This has lost its trunk. ~ STUMP
A68. What Dad found in his stocking on Christmas. ~ HOLE
A69. Additional covering of a seed. ~ ARIL
A70. This is very painful. ~ THROE
A71. This is what the inquiring reporter does. ~ ASKS
A72. Acquires. ~ GETS
